<title>NETHERLANDS: BRAAT DROPS INTO THE RED IN 1996.</title>
<headline>BRAAT DROPS INTO THE RED IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 6.6  vs   0.6 profit</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops     1.0  vs   1.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				62.6  vs  59.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 1.1  vs   1.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges		7.6  vs   0.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Textiles firm Braat Beheer NV said its 1996</p>
<p>extraordinary charges included a 5.1 million guilder</p>
<p>reorganisation charge.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
